(go/const ^{:val 0.0 :doc "allocWords is the words allocated as Gc's counters give them: oi does not count an OCaml\nprogram's allocations (its values are Go's, with Go's sizes and escape analysis), so the\ncounters stay at zero: a program that checks that a computation does not allocate sees none, one\nthat measures an allocation sees none either (a class, OC64).\n"} allocWords (conv float64 0))
